WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:06.410
In 1429, a French peasant girl led French
forces to lift the siege of Orléans.

2
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:11.790
Joan of Arc said that voices and visions
of saints had told her to help her king.

3
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.630
Two years later she was burned at Rouen.

4
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.720
In 1920, she was declared a saint.

5
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:22.540
So if someone sees a vision, how could
anyone tell whether it really came from

6
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.620
God?

7
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.500
In this mission, you'll
meet visions in scripture,

8
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.830
from Abram under the stars to a
mountaintop in Matthew's Gospel.

9
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.790
Then you'll hear the
sceptics: hallucination,

10
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.960
wishful thinking, and
seeing what you expect.

11
00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:41.590
Your mission: find out how anyone could
tell whether a vision really came from

12
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.190
God.
